# Idea Hub Architecture

## Stack

- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy async + Postgres + Redis (OTP) under `backend/`
- **Frontend**: Vite + React 18 + TypeScript under `frontend/`
- **Auth**: email+password → Redis OTP → JWT cookies (Kompass-admin pattern)
- **API prefix**: `/api/v1`

## Spine vs phases

| Layer | What it owns | Entry |
|-------|----------------|-------|
| Spine | Auth, users/roles, ideas lifecycle, explore, engagement, review | `routers/{auth,users,ideas,review}` |
| Phase 2+3 | Ideathons, recognition, profiles, delivery, collab, admin | `phase23_register.include_phase23_routers` |
| Phase 4+5+6 | Agents, insights, problems, reopen, etc. | `phase456_register.include_phase456_routers` |

Do not invent new top-level apps. Extend the existing register helpers when adding phase routers.

## Backend layering (required)

```
routers → services → repositories/models
schemas validate I/O; dependencies handle auth
```

- Routers: HTTP only (status codes, deps, schema in/out)
- Services: business rules, status transitions, side effects (email, Redis)
- Repositories: SQL / persistence; no HTTP knowledge
- Never put secrets in code or commit `backend/.env` — use `.env.example` placeholders

## Frontend map

- Pages: `frontend/src/pages/`
- API clients: `frontend/src/api/`
- Auth: `frontend/src/auth/`
- Design tokens: `frontend/src/styles/tokens.css` (must match `idea-hub.html`)

## Local run (preferred)

```bash
cd backend && ./scripts/dev-services.sh up && uv sync && uv run alembic upgrade head && uv run python -m app.seed.demo
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
cd frontend && npm run dev   # :5173
```

Seed users/password: see `backend/README.md` (never invent new seed secrets).
